orm. The draft's assertion that stability under the matrix units supplies that fact is not established: it has already treated the image A_R and its standard matrix units as operators on that rational span, while the argument establishing those matrix units is written in the standard Q-form. Resolving this requires a careful scalar-field descent/localization argument; I cannot treat this as a routine detail without introducing an unsupported identification.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"The frozen source-context allows an arbitrary admissible lattice in a complex module, not just a lattice in the standard integral form. The matrix-unit formulas establish rational matrices in the standard basis, but do not by themselves define a rational form containing M. The exact passage is needed for every later coordinate-ideal and reduction assertion. Per the authoring rules, I stop rather than silently assume the missing rational-form compatibility or replace the proof route.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"The displayed highest-weight and divided-power formulas in the standard basis are locally verifiable. Conditional on a valid identification of M localized at p with a full lattice in the standard rational form, the matrix-unit and fractional-ideal arguments would compare its reduction with the standard reduction, after which matrix units prove irreducibility including λ=0 and p=2. No NL0 artifact has been submitted because the gap blocks the target proof.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Stop this stage honestly on a substantive or suspected proof gap, unavailable source, or input conflict. JSON fields: status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. Status must be SUBSTANTIVE_GAP, SUSPECTED_GAP, SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT. Difficulty alone is not a mathematical error.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"ou